From 6a7debb5f098e0788cd703e4dcf19f20acbc6e79 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Bernhard=20Rosenkr=C3=A4nzer?= <bero@lindev.ch>
Date: Sun, 12 Jul 2026 18:23:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 01/10] Bug 2054387 - Build system: add cairo-qt toolkit option
 and wiring. r?#firefox-build-system-reviewers

Add --enable-default-toolkit=cairo-qt configure support, AppConstants
MOZ_WIDGET_QT, moz.build toolkit selection, and related build hooks so a
Qt 6 widget backend can be selected without implementing widget code yet
in this commit's intent (files land together with later commits in the
stack).

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D311735
